First: What is Containerization? 📦

Containerization is the process of packaging an application together with everything it needs to run.

Your application needs:

Python
FastAPI
Required libraries
Your main.py
HTML, CSS, JavaScript
Configuration

Instead of installing everything manually on every server:

New Server
   ↓
Install Python
   ↓
Install FastAPI
   ↓
Install Libraries
   ↓
Copy Project
   ↓
Configure Application
   ↓
Run

=======

Containerization packages everything together:

Your Application
      +
Python
      +
FastAPI
      +
Libraries
      ↓
📦 CONTAINER

This container can run consistently in different environments.

=========

